{"module":"practice","item":{"id":"b1-practice-27","level":"B1","kind":"mcq","title":{"de":"Das Passiv","bn":"Passiv: কী করা হয়"},"questions":[{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Das Fahrrad ___ heute in der Werkstatt repariert.","options":["ist","wird","werden"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Passiv বর্তমান: wird + Partizip II।","id":"b1-practice-27-q1"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Die E-Mail wird ___. (schreiben)","options":["schreibt","schreiben","geschrieben"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-27-q2"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Das Auto wurde repariert.“ মানে কী?","options":["গাড়িটি মেরামত করা হয়েছিল।","গাড়িটি মেরামত করা হচ্ছে।","গাড়িটি মেরামত করা হবে।"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-27-q3"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Die Fenster ___ geputzt.","options":["werdet","werden","wird"],"answer":1,"explanation":"বহুবচন → werden।","id":"b1-practice-27-q4"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"অতীতের Passiv-এ কোন রূপ লাগে?","options":["wird + infinitive","würde + infinitive","wurde + Partizip II"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-27-q5"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„Der Mechaniker repariert das Auto.“ এর Passiv কোনটি?","options":["Das Auto wird repariert.","Das Auto repariert.","Das Auto hat repariert."],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-27-q6"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Gestern ___ die Wohnung geputzt.","options":["würde","wurde","wird"],"answer":1,"explanation":"gestern → অতীত: wurde।","id":"b1-practice-27-q7"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Hier ___ Deutsch gelernt.","options":["werden","ist","wird"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-27-q8"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Du ___ weniger Zucker essen. (পরামর্শ)","options":["solltest","sollst","sollte"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-27-q9"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„An deiner Stelle würde ich weniger Kaffee trinken.“ মানে কী?","options":["তুমি কেন কফি খাও না?","তোমার জায়গায় আমি হলে কম কফি খেতাম।","আমি তোমার জন্য কফি বানাব।"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-27-q10"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„satt“ মানে কী?","options":["ক্ষুধার্ত","ঝাল","তৃপ্ত, পেট ভরা"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-27-q11"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„hausgemacht“ মানে কী?","options":["ঘরে তৈরি","ভাজা","মিশ্রিত"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-27-q12"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Wenn ich mehr Zeit ___, würde ich jeden Tag kochen.","options":["hatte","hätte","habe"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-27-q13"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Die Briefe ___ gestern geschickt.","options":["wurde","wird","wurden"],"answer":2,"explanation":"বহুবচন, অতীত → wurden।","id":"b1-practice-27-q14"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich koche viel Gemüse, damit meine Kinder gesund ___.","options":["bleiben","bleibt","zu bleiben"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-27-q15"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Das Essen ___ um zwölf Uhr gekocht.","options":["würde","wird","werden"],"answer":1,"explanation":"das Essen (একবচন) → wird।","id":"b1-practice-27-q16"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Die Brötchen ___ jeden Morgen frisch gebacken.","options":["wird","wurde","werden"],"answer":2,"explanation":"die Brötchen (বহুবচন) → werden।","id":"b1-practice-27-q17"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Das Haus ___ 1950 gebaut.","options":["wurde","wird","würde"],"answer":0,"explanation":"অতীতের Passiv: wurde।","id":"b1-practice-27-q18"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Im Restaurant:\n„Bei uns wird jeden Tag frisch gekocht. Das Brot wird hier gebacken, und das Gemüse wird morgens auf dem Markt gekauft.“\nসবজি কোথা থেকে কেনা হয়?","options":["বাগান থেকে","বাজার থেকে","সুপারমার্কেট থেকে"],"answer":1,"explanation":"das Gemüse wird … auf dem Markt gekauft।","id":"b1-practice-27-q19"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Der Kuchen, ___ gestern gebacken ___, ist schon weg.","options":["den … wurde","der … wird","der … wurde"],"answer":2,"explanation":"der Kuchen, Nominativ → der; গতকাল → wurde।","id":"b1-practice-27-q20"}],"requires":{"grammar":13,"vocabulary":13}},"schema":1,"id":"b1-practice-27","level":"B1","test":[]}